     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Hi everyone, an update to the\r\n<b>konfound </b>R package (v 1.0.2) is now available on CRAN. </div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">This update reflects a number of changes, particularly changes and improvements to how the konfound function works when the test_all argument (to quantify the robustness of\r\n<i>every </i>coefficient in a model) is set to true. Special thanks to J. Murphy for his testing, suggestions and edits, and feedback regarding these changes and improvements.</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Documentation for the package is available here: <a rel=\"nofollow\">file://localhost/Users/joshuarosenberg/Documents/konfound/docs/index.html</a></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">An interactive web application is also available here: <a href=\"https://jmichaelrosenberg.shinyapps.io/konfound-it/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://jmichaelrosenberg.shinyapps.io/konfound-it/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244520515000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2dmQA1l8Ro9bjdm2DNJgSP\">https://jmichaelrosenberg.shinyapps.io/konfound-it/</a></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div></div>\r\n<div></div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size:12pt;color:#000000;font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif\">\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif\"></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">\r\n<a name=\"m_3823660196606182048__MailAutoSig\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Times\">-- <br>\r\n</span></a><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/konfound-it/attach/8409ea289a1c2/Outlook-4p500dsj.png?part=0.1&amp;view=1\"><br>\r\n</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"> </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">\r\n<b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Helvetica;color:#58595b\"><a href=\"https://joshuamrosenberg.com/\" title=\"https://joshuamrosenberg.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://joshuamrosenberg.com/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244520515000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0MsrP9RzZIf-dQKVGtOzDI\">Joshua M. Rosenberg</a></span></b></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Helvetica;color:#58595b\">Assistant Professor, STEM Education</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Helvetica;color:#58595b\"> </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Helvetica;color:#58595b\">The University of Tennessee, Knoxville</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font